visor-chat-equip = Your character has assumed the personality, mannerisms, and form of {$name}. Once you take off the equipped item with the action, you will return to normal.
visor-chat-equip-alternate = Your character has assumed the form of {$name}. Once you take off the visor with the equipped item, you will return to normal.
visor-chat-equip-nomem = Your character has assumed the personality, mannerisms, and form of {$name}. Your memories of who you were before did not transfer. Once you take off the equipped item with the action, you will return to normal, but your memories from the time won't transfer back.

visor-popup-equip = The form of {$newName} envelops {$oldName}!
visor-popup-equip-alternate = The form of {$newName} envelops {$oldName} from the visor!
visor-popup-equip-alternate-hat = The form of {$newName} envelops {$oldName} from the hat!

visor-popup-dequip = {$newName}'s form retreats into {$oldName} as they return to normal.
visor-popup-dequip-alternate = {$newName}'s form retreats into {$oldName}'s visor as they return to normal.
visor-popup-dequip-alternate-hat = {$newName}'s form retreats into {$oldName}'s hat as they return to normal.

